      "group_ref": "G-AP-BRACKETS",
      "instruction": "Each question shows two groups of words in brackets. Choose ONE word from the first group and ONE word from the second group so that the two words you pick are as nearly OPPOSITE in meaning as possible. Both words must be right to score the mark.",
      "example": "(early, striped, wooden)   (square, late, heavy) — early and late are opposites, so those are the two words to choose."
    }
